<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">3 Yohans</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 Yohans</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 Yohans Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Yoh.</para>
  <para style="mt">Wosheetso Yohans Keezlo Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohans keezlo b́ woshts wosho b́guut'e «Woshets eenasho Yohansn,» wotefetst, guut'ewwere Gayiyosi eteets Ik'i maa jishirwosha b́ tesh, guut'tsman ik weeron Ik'i ashuwotsi b́ tep'tsotse Gayiyos b́ údiri, k'osh weeronowere Diwotrefis eteets gond asho atsatse bíatsokorb́dek'etwok'owa bísh b́gawiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Gayiyos b́ údetsok'o 5-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Diyotrefisi k'ooretsok'oo 9-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Dimet'rosi b́ údetsok'o 11-12</para>
  <para style="io1">K'auwunon beezewor 13-15</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1"/>Arikon t shuntso, shunetso Gayiyossh, Tiyoke eenashoke, <verse eid="3JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2"/>T shuntsono! n be jamo neesh b́ kááwitwok'o, jeenono nwotitwok'o, jam weeron neesh b́sheengetwok'owe Ik'o tk'oniri. <verse eid="3JN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3"/>Arosh ni amanetsok'onat aron n beeyirwok'on krstiyani wotts eshu ik ikwots waat bokeewor aydek'atniye t geneúwi. <verse eid="3JN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4"/>T nana'wots arikon ananefetst bobeyrwok'o shishoniye bogo taan geneúshit keewo aaliye.<verse eid="3JN 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gayyosi udetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5"/>T shuntsono! neesh dab ib bowotiyalor eshu eshuwotssh amanek fine nfiniri. <verse eid="3JN 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6"/>Bowere boosh shunon nfints fino Ik'i maa shinatse kishdek't keewrnee, andoor Ik'o genee'ushitwok'on bowerindosh boon ntep'al sheenge. <verse eid="3JN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7"/>Krstossh finosh bokeshor amanerawwotsoke eegor tep'o dek'keyatsnee. <verse eid="3JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8"/>Ari fin finrwotsnton finirwotsi nowotitwok'o hanotsk'o ashuwotsnton fino noon geyife.<verse eid="3JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deyotrefs k'oretsok'onat Dimet'rosi udetsok'on</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9"/>Haniyere shinon Ik' moosh wosho guut're b́teshi, ernmo Ik' maa jish geyirwo Diyotrefis ti ettso de'atse. <verse eid="3JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10"/>Eshe itok twoor bí noon c'ashfetst, ketifetst b́ k'alts gond fin jamo keewitwe, man bísh bodob́k'aye bí b́ tookish eshu eshuwotsi de'ake. K'oshwotswere bo de'awok'owe b́bazifoni. Ik'i mootsnowere boon b́gishefoni.<verse eid="3JN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11"/>T shuntsono! sheengo arowe bako gondo ark'aye. Sheeng finiru jamo Ik'ikee. Gond finirwonmó Ik'o be'atse.<verse eid="3JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12"/>Dimet'ros jangosh ash jamo sheengkewon bísh gawirunee. Arunuwere b tookon bísh gawitwanee. Noowere gawitwone, nogawonwere ar b́ wotok'o danfnee.<verse eid="3JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13"/>Neesh guut'osh t geetso ay keewo detsfe b́ teshi, wotowa eree worek'atats neesh guut'o geeratse. <verse eid="3JN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14"/>Karnon neen bek'oshe jangirwe, manoor noonon keewetwone.<verse eid="3JN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="3JN 1:15"/>Jeeno neesh wotowe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:15">Hanoki n tooh tohuwots neesh jamo t'intsirune. Neewere no tohuwotssh jamo ik ikon t'intsuwe.<verse eid="3JN 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1"/>
</usx>
